The Harrowgate Herald

FROM THE PRESIDENT'S DESK
Thank you all for a strong first quarter. Our fill rate stayed above 97% whil=
e we moved the bulk stainless line to the new racking.

COMMUNITY
Our food drive collected 1,180 pounds for the Mid-Ohio food pantry. Thanks to=
 everyone who donated.

KUDOS
Shout-out to Bonnie Szymanski for staying late to get the Ashgrove Pumps rush=
 order out the door. That's the Harrowgate way.

TECH TIP
You can now reset your own password from the login screen. Ted would like to =
never hear the words 'I'm locked out' again.

